# Unity / Tuanjie YAML assets: NEVER auto-merge line-by-line.
# Both sides editing a .scene/.prefab produces GUID-breaking merges that
# silently corrupt the scene. Mark them as unmergeable so Git stops with a
# conflict and we resolve it manually inside the editor instead.
#
# NOTE: intentionally NOT wiring the `unityyamlmerge` driver, because it is
# not configured on every collaborator's machine; a missing driver makes the
# merge fail hard. `-merge` alone gives us a clean, explicit conflict.
*.unity  -merge
*.scene  -merge
*.prefab -merge
*.asset  -merge
*.mat    -merge

# Binary assets
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tga  binary
*.psd  binary
*.fbx  binary
*.exr  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.mp4  binary
